PROSES 2 : SETELAH SORT DATA & REMOVE DUPLICATES SELESAI MAKA REFRESH PIVOT

Versi 1 — Refresh Semua Pivot di Sheet Aktif
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sub Refresh_All_Pivot_In_ActiveSheet()

    Dim pt As PivotTable
    
    For Each pt In ActiveSheet.PivotTables
        pt.RefreshTable
    Next pt
    
    MsgBox "Semua Pivot di sheet ini sudah di-refresh!"

End Sub
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Versi 2 — Refresh Pivot di Sheet Tertentu (Lebih Aman)
👉 Misalnya sheet kamu namanya: Dashboard Sales
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sub Refresh_Pivot_Specific_Sheet()

    Dim ws As Worksheet
    Dim pt As PivotTable
    
    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets("Dashboard Sales")
    
    For Each pt In ws.PivotTables
        pt.RefreshTable
    Next pt
    
    MsgBox "Pivot di Dashboard Sales sudah di-refresh!"

End Sub
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
👉 Ganti "Dashboard Sales" sesuai nama sheet kamu
